Then another.<break time="300ms"/>
Then five.<break time="600ms"/>
The map zoomed out without anyone touching it.<break time="550ms"/>
City level.<break time="350ms"/>
Red.<break time="450ms"/>
County level.<break time="350ms"/>
More red.<break time="450ms"/>
State.<break time="600ms"/>
The screen paused.<break time="600ms"/>
Then zoomed again.<break time="800ms"/>
Kade stopped breathing for a second.<break time="700ms"/>
